WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.575
Next, how administrators sign in.

2
00:00:02.575 --> 00:00:05.523
The platform supports single
sign-on with Entra ID,

3
00:00:05.523 --> 00:00:09.384
so the program's approach is to put
the console behind Entra and let

4
00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:14.438
administrators use their PIV card through
Entra's certificate-based authentication.

5
00:00:14.438 --> 00:00:18.778
That way there's one trust store and
one set of Conditional Access rules,

6
00:00:18.778 --> 00:00:21.500
instead of a second
login system to maintain.

7
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.950
Keep the platform's own
certificate login as a fallback,

8
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:28.475
keep a local break-glass
account, and shorten the default

9
00:00:28.475 --> 00:00:31.990
token lifetimes for automation
— ninety days is too long.
